            "title": "美光加碼投資台灣、景氣燈號連9紅、亞馬遜參與金像電私募 本周大事回顧",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2052438ed86976976b113faceef479b25a6873a5aa860d7cdb668f63b431cd05/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F12ed99ed088d4c6888fc6b95b9d171f2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
