        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉立碁布局1.6T光模組有成Q4看旺 周漲12.3%創波段新高",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">LED封裝廠立碁(8111-TW)受惠於積極跨足矽光子領域並直攻1.6T與3.2T高階光收發模組，加上第4季營運逐步回溫，激勵本周買盤大舉湧入，2日攻上漲停價85.8元，周漲幅約12%，周成交量約5萬張。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">針對市場高度聚焦的矽光子業務，立碁跳過市場既有的單通道100G方案，直接鎖定單通道200G技術，從光引擎延伸至光收發模組，全面布局1.6T與3.2T高階規格。公司指出1.6T光模組要價千美元起跳，具備高技術門檻，一旦未來良率與經濟規模拉升，毛利率可望自40%起跳，中長期營收占比更上看五成以上。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-57aa3ca4-a7a4-3b7d-9436-3e8cdab30986-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">立碁營運主要由既有紅外線光模組及政府標案支撐，紅外線產品鎖定500萬與800萬畫素以上規格，積極切入人工智慧影像辨識、車載與自動駕駛等高階市場。配合未來新事業產能建置，樹林無塵室初期數十K產能已陸續備妥，預期第4季整體營運將優於第3季，明年營收與獲利亦朝同步優於今年的方向邁進。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"立碁K線圖走勢\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1710bb5ce19c0ee9a28e03343d5a2fb0768867749