        {
            "title": "〈熱門股〉晟銘電機櫃出貨逐季增Q4展望正面 周漲近1成收復季線關",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">伺服器機殼廠晟銘電(3013-TW)今年聚焦毛利水準較高機櫃業務，累計今年前8月L11系統整合業務營收比重達18%，加上輝達(NVDA-US)VR200放量出貨，第四季展望正面，激勵晟銘電本周漲近1成，收復季線關卡。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">晟銘電本周漲幅9.7%，周五(2日)最高漲至94.3元，收92.7元，除站回90元關卡，也同步收復5日線及季線。至於三大法人本周籌碼動向，本周合計賣超1489張。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">晟銘電今年前8月營收比重中，伺服器相關業務營收比重降至73%，主因為L11系統整合業務占比提高至18%，今年有8至9成的ODM專案由過去的機箱業務轉為機櫃業務，預期機櫃業務比重將持續提升，動能將延續至明年。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-e318b23a-9b4f-33b6-80a4-b12c217a4263-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">晟銘電補充，目前已完成輝達GB300、VR200等標準品機箱已開好模具，而第四季起VR200將陸續量產出貨，公司也參與其中，可望同步受惠，並帶動第四季營運，展望正面。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=